        "text": "Performance & Benchmarks\nMOSS-Transcribe-Diarize-0.9B is built for messy, real-world speech: multi-speaker meetings, interruptions, long conversations, and partially overlapping speech.\nInstead of running ASR, diarization, and alignment as separate steps, the model handles",
